{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1553365-exalted-essence-wyld-supplements","id":1553365,"title":"Exalted Essence Wyld Supplements","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-08-21T23:44:34-07:00","id":1553365,"title":"Exalted Essence Wyld Supplements","content":"A while back on the fan discord I made a pair of 40 page supplements for Exalted Essence that I realized I never shared here.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vfCYA9lLFlDwwaM6-TacL-_EqFwRp79orsHIwqVcXgg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Princes of Chaos</a> is a player focused supplement for playing the Raksha in ExEss with as much content as a splat in ExEss Core. Featuring:<ul><li>Assumption-based Caspects, letting you define your subtype by the aspects of Creation you embody.</li> <li>Specific rules for fae characters, including unique recovery rules, a gossamer system that replaces anima, rules for feeding, a virtue-based dice adder that replaces excellencies, and a new type of Oath merit which act akin to artifact intimacies.</li> <li>Bedlam, a variant of the Great Curse for Raksha</li> <li>4 modes for every ability's universal charms</li> <li>Unique charms based around graces. Rather than a separate stat as a prereq, Graces act as charm-granted artifacts which act as the foundational charm for each tree, with higher prereqs requiring more charms in a tree.</li> <li>Charms for alternate feeding methods, combining assumptions, manipulating intimacies in unconventional ways, manipulating the world through influence abilities, transforming themselves and others, summoning horrors and more!</li> <li>Wyld forged artifacts including a description of their themes, how they're made, resonance, and half a dozen examples based on old shaping weapons.</li> <li>A <u>brief</u> subsystem for shaping duels based on the warfare rules in ExEss.</li> </ul><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1g9rO3ZY5oo8sGlIAkUqSGNekjATfWoe95uwhaz8To5s/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Wyld</a> is a storyteller focused supplement for running games set in the wyld, focused on actionable guidelines and exalt-focused stories. Featuring:<ul><li>A breakdown of the wyld at a glance, zeroing in on how to use and present locations in the wyld.</li> <li>A list of inspirations both recent and older to act as signposts for the wyld.</li> <li>A series of 15 example plots utilizing the wyld or the fae.</li> <li>A six step guide to building a region in the wyld, from its themes to its inhabitants.</li> <li>An overview of how Raksha courts twist the wyld and how to portray them.<ul><li>An entirely original raksha court called Lucerna, the Chancery of Lanterns.</li> </ul></li> <li>A series of optional rules for running the wyld including alternate hazard rules, suggestions for journey ventures and a repeat of Wyld Forged Artifacts that's intended as more NPC facing.</li> <li>A guidelines for building fae antagonists, including:<ul><li>General fae built using existing templates, with 6 examples both old and new.</li> <li>An antagonist-facing version of the Raksha building on their content in ExEss core and Pillars featuring nearly 50 unique npc qualities organized by Grace, 3 stat templates for raksha of different tiers and 7 example raksha both general and bespoke divided between those tiers with their own lore.</li> <li>A homebrew version of the Hannya as an antagonist of the deep wyld that even the Raksha fear with 10 terrifying unique qualities and an additional template for a less hostile form a Hannya may take on after consuming too many names.</li> </ul></li> <li>A take on the Unshaped built around the idea of becoming trapped in a living story trying to force you down a role it set out for you, with unique traits, rules and qualities for running this threat.</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26927-sylvanvixen","name":"SylvanVixen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-09-09T16:34:54-07:00","id":1553724,"title":"","content":"That's great! Now for the <i>other </i>thing I'd like to get for Exalted Essence: Dragon Kings and Mountain Folk. If ExEs ever gets an expansion (other than the upcoming PG), I would love for it to focus on the Raksha, the Mountain Folk, and the Dragon Kings, the non-human species of the setting.<br /> <br /> By the way: is the Storyteller's Vault allowing fan supplements for ExEs? If so, I'd love to see your work posted there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-09-19T05:11:13-07:00","id":1553919,"title":"","content":"These look very useful to me and cross them off of my &quot;to write&quot; list. I've been rereading <i>Graceful Wicked Masques</i> with the goal of fitting raksha into Exalted Essence, and now I don't have to. Running a game set out on the edges of Creation is on my list of things to run, after a game set in the West (including the Realm Civil War), and a Caul focused game.<br /> <br /> Thanks for you hard work and I'd definitely buy these when they show up on STV.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Lead Writer for the Savage Age of Werewolf: the Apocalypse: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/428750/Ghost-Lineages-The-Advanced-Players-Guide-to-the-Savage-Age\" target=\"_blank\">Ghost Lineages</a>, <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/312700/The-Rise-of-the-Garou-The-Savage-Age-Volume-Two\" target=\"_blank\">Rise of the Garou</a>, <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/331302/Tools-of-Extinction-The-Savage-Age-Volume-Three\" target=\"_blank\">Tools of Extinction</a>, <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/352717/Tribebook-Wlewa\" target=\"_blank\">Tribebook: Wlewa</a>.<br /> <br /> Want RPGs in libraries? Check out my book, <a href=\"http://www.abc-clio.com/ABC-CLIOCorporate/product.aspx?pc=A3951P\" target=\"_blank\">Dragons in the Stacks</a>. Now with <a href=\"http://www.ennie-awards.com/blog/2015-ennie-award-nominees-and-spotlight-winners/\" target=\"_blank\">awards</a>!<br /> \u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1813-grimjaws","name":"grimjaws","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1813_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}